# The feedback relay's key, when running `npx vercel dev` locally.
# RESEND_API_KEY belongs in Vercel's own environment variables for the deployed
# site; a local .env exists only so the function can be exercised on a laptop.
# There was no .gitignore here at all until the relay arrived, because a site
# made entirely of static HTML had nothing worth withholding.
.env
.env.*

# `vercel dev` and `vercel link` write here.
.vercel

.DS_Store
